        "digitized_from": "DataSF Assessor parcels (acdm-wktn), lot 8709018 (mapped 2010-01-12; active); the earlier outline came from: DataSF Building Footprints (mblr SF8709018); name/address from OpenStreetMap way 84805709 (1500 Owens St)",
        "digitization_method": "ADDED 2026-09-19 for Mission Bay's third real-buildings pass (remaining uncovered footprints inside the official Mission Bay North/South redevelopment-area boundary): 1500 Owens St, a UCSF Health outpatient medical building housing Radiology, Sports Medicine, Physical Therapy & Rehabilitation, Orthopedic Surgery Center, and Gynecology & Urogynecology clinics at Mission Bay. 2026-09-29 accuracy audit: of the clinics listed above, only Radiology (Musculoskeletal Imaging) is confirmed at 1500 Owens by the cited UCSF Health page and OSM way; Sports Medicine, Physical Therapy & Rehabilitation, Orthopedic Surgery Center and Gynecology & Urogynecology are not stated in any cited source. REPLACED 2026-10-12 (shape; status and use unchanged): the owner approved building records whose outline matches an Assessor lot at 85% or better, both ways, using the lot (CLAUDE.md, 'An official parcel beats our drawing'). DataSF's Assessor layer (data/raw/parcels.geojson) has Assessor lot 8709018 (4,257 m2, active, mapped 2010-01-12); the earlier outline of 2,645 m2 and the lot overlap with IoU 0.62 (100% of the earlier outline lies inside the lot and it covers 62% of the lot). The outline is now that lot using the lots' own vertices (no simplification). geometry_type stays 'real'. Previous digitized_from: 'DataSF Building Footprints (mblr SF8709018); name/address from OpenStreetMap way 84805709 (1500 Owens St)'. Previous accuracy_caveat: 'REAL -- surveyed DataSF Building Footprints outline (mblr SF8709018), cross-referenced by position against an OpenStreetMap building/address point (way 84805709) for the name and street address; not a hand trace or plan estimate. Construction is dated by DBI permit 200611298694 (filed 2006-11-29, completed 2009-07-31) and the Assessor's year built (2009); the architect is not confirmed by any source found.'.",
        "accuracy_caveat": "REAL lot geometry -- the outline is Assessor lot 8709018 (4,257 m2, active), so its edges are recorded lot lines, not a surveyed building footprint: it includes any yard, setback or plaza inside the lot and can sit a little off the walls. Until 2026-10-12 this record showed the surveyed building footprint (DataSF Building Footprints (mblr SF8709018)); 100% of that outline lies inside the lot and it covered 62% of the lot.",
        "notes": "Construction dated by DBI permit 200611298694 (filed 2006-11-29, completed 2009-07-31) and the Assessor's 2009 year built; architect not confirmed by any source found.",
